{"id": "38366", "title": "牛虻世家", "author": "艾捷尔·丽莲·伏尼契", "category": "文学名著", "count": 24, "available": 11, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/38/38366.htm", "intro": "比阿特丽斯是牛虻的曾外祖母，她的一生遭受过各种苦难：婚前，她失去父亲；又险遭继父的蹂躏；婚后，爱子包比惨死，次子迪克天性贪婪，去做有钱人家的养子，她最敬爱的哥哥沃尔特舍己救人，横死海上；她本人又身患癌症。弥留时，她向养子亚瑟和女儿格拉迪斯祝福，希望他们能成为善良的人。这是一部心理小说，它着力塑造了比阿特丽斯这样一个典型人物，从她的坚强、善良和正直的性格中，我们可以看到牛虻性格形成的根源这也是作者的立意之所在。", "base": "files/article/html/38/38366", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "3110486.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "3110487.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "3110488.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "3110489.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "3110490.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "3110491.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "3110492.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "3110493.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "3110494.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "3110495.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "3110496.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "3110497.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "3110498.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "3110499.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "3110500.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "3110501.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第二部", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "3110503.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "3110504.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "3110505.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "3110506.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "3110507.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "3110508.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "3110509.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "3110510.html", "available": tru